WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.870
Here is a crown that looks like pure gold.

2
00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:05.360
But looks can fool you.

3
00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:08.890
A thin plating can make a
cheap metal look precious.

4
00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:12.590
And you may not scratch it,
cut it, or melt it down.

5
00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:15.700
So how could you test whether
the crown is pure gold,

6
00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:17.680
without leaving a mark?

7
00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:21.450
In this mission, you'll meet a
property that belongs to a material,

8
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.730
not to the object made from it.

9
00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:26.300
Then you'll work through
a solid brass cylinder,

10
00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:30.580
step by step, and learn to
switch units without slips.

11
00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:33.570
Your mission: explain
how to test the crown,

12
00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:35.320
without damaging it at all.
